The working vocabulary of ML Pipelines — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **scikit-learn pipelines** — preprocessing inside the fold
- **Column transformers for mixed data types** — Mixed data types: different preprocessing per column group (scale numerics, encode categoricals) in one leak-free step.
- **Serializing models and preprocessing together** — The pipeline refits transformers per split — statistics from validation/test never reach training.
- **Batch scoring vs online serving patterns** — Batch is simpler and cheaper for periodic needs; online serving gives fresh predictions per request but needs an API, validation, and monitoring.
- **Scheduling retrains** — from cron to orchestrators

