**Project brief — ML Pipelines.**
Pipelines are where leakage dies and reproducibility is born: every transformation inside the pipeline, versioned, and re-runnable by someone else.

**Deliverable.** A working artifact plus a one-page writeup demonstrating: Scikit-learn pipelines: preprocessing inside the fold; Column transformers for mixed data types; Serializing models and preprocessing together; Batch scoring vs online serving patterns; Scheduling retrains: from cron to orchestrators.
**Done when.** Someone else can rerun your artifact from your writeup, and the writeup states what you tried, what moved the result, and the limits you did not evaluate.

