The working vocabulary of Deployment Practice — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Packaging** — from notebook to importable project
- **Serving predictions over a REST API** — Serving, input contracts, and prediction logging are the production floor — everything else builds on them.
- **Input validation** — the contract between app and model
- **Logging predictions for later audit** — Logged predictions with inputs enable later audit, drift detection, error analysis, and building future training sets.
- **Rollback plans and shadow deployments** — Shadow the new model on live traffic without serving decisions, and keep the previous artifact versioned with a one-command revert triggered by a metric threshold.

