The working vocabulary of Model Interpretation — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Feature importance** — what it measures, what it hides
- **Partial dependence and individual conditional expectation** — The marginal effect of one feature on predictions, averaging out the others — global interpretation with interaction blind spots.
