The working vocabulary of GenAI Evaluation — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Benchmarks** — what they measure and what they hide
- **Task-specific evals** — build your own
- **LLM-as-judge** — useful, biased, and gameable
- **Human evaluation done affordably** — Sample strategically, use clear rubrics, measure agreement — small, well-run human evals beat large sloppy ones.
- **Regression suites for model updates** — Every model or prompt change can silently break working behavior — the suite is the gate that catches it.

