The working vocabulary of GenAI Capstone — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Scoping a GenAI system you can finish** — One task, one data source, one eval set — a thin slice that works beats a platform that does not.
- **Adaptation** — fine-tune or retrieve (or both)
