The working vocabulary of Embeddings — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Sentence embeddings** — from words to meaning vectors
- **Similarity search over embedding indexes** — Encode the query, find nearest vectors by cosine similarity — sub-linear with an ANN index at scale.
- **Clustering and topic discovery** — Topic structure in unlabeled text — discovery before labeling, guiding what is worth annotating.
- **Evaluating embeddings on your task, not benchmarks** — Benchmark leaders can flop on your domain’s vocabulary and phrasing — your retrieval/classification task is the only judge that counts.
- **Multilingual embeddings at a glance** — One space for many languages — cross-lingual search and transfer, with quality varying by language coverage.

