The working vocabulary of Evaluation Harnesses — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Golden datasets** — curating representative cases
- **Regression evals on every change** — Model, prompt, or retrieval tweaks can silently break working behavior — the suite is the gate.
- **LLM judges** — useful and gameable
- **Human review loops for the hard cases** — The hard cases: ambiguity, safety, high stakes — humans grade what automation cannot be trusted with.
- **Tracing** — logging the full pipeline per request

