The working vocabulary of Tool Use in Features — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Function calling** — schemas as contracts
- **Tool design** — narrow, typed, and safe
- **Error handling when tools fail** — Validate arguments, catch errors, return structured failures the model can reason about, and retry with backoff where safe.
- **Least privilege for model-invoked tools** — Each tool gets only the permissions its job needs — bounding the blast radius of model mistakes.
- **Testing tool-using features** — Unit-test the tools, integration-test the loop with mocked models, and red-team adversarial arguments — like any integration surface.

