**Project brief — Shipping AI Features.**
The other 90% of an AI feature: flags, guardrails, honest UX, feedback loops, and cost controls — the parts demos skip and launches need.

**Deliverable.** A working artifact plus a one-page writeup demonstrating: Feature flags for model-backed behavior; Guardrails: input and output controls; UX for uncertainty: confidence, citations, corrections; Feedback logging: turning usage into eval data; Cost controls: budgets, caching, and routing.
**Done when.** Someone else can rerun your artifact from your writeup, and the writeup states what you tried, what moved the result, and the limits you did not evaluate.

