The working vocabulary of Data Strategy — learn these cold; everything else in the module hangs off them.
- **Data audits** — what exists, what is missing, what is lying
- **Labeling strategy for real budgets** — Guidelines, agreement measurement, active learning for the uncertain cases, and audits — quality per dollar.
